</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 77.28)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:4.59em;font-size:10pt;" height="72.99" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.49)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">System prompt<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: <span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">You are a humorous assistant that understands comics. You will be given comics and your task is to evaluate the comics.</span>

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Question 6<span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: <span id="A5.p4.pic1.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Explain why this comic is funny or not funny in 3 sentences.</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
