<span id="A7.T16.4.10.7.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T16.4.10.7.1.1" class="ltx_p">This comic is funny because it uses humor to highlight the challenges and frustrations of learning to code. The conversation between the two characters is relatable to anyone who has struggled with coding, and the punchline is unexpected and amusing. The comic also uses visual humor, with the character’s expressions and body language adding to the humor. 
<br class="ltx_break">Score: [2,4]</span>
</span></td></tr>
