<th id="A7.T17.4.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_l ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">Groundtruth</th>
<th id="A7.T17.4.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T17.4.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:42.7pt;">
<span id="A7.T17.4.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">1,3,2,4</span>
</span></th>
<th id="A7.T17.4.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T17.4.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T17.4.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">1: COME EXPLORE THE FUTURE WITH ME! HUH? WHAT’S THAT YOU’RE IN? 3: TWO-SEAT KAYAK! I SEE, BUT WHY DO YOU HAVE IT? 2: WE’LL FIND OUT! THE FUTURE IS A BIG PLACE! SO THE KAYAK TRAVELS THROUGH TIME? 4: SURE! JUST LIKE EVERYTHING ELSE! IT ALSO GOES OVER WATER. COME ON!</span>
</span></th>
<th id="A7.T17.4.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A7.T17.4.4.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:142.3pt;">
<span id="A7.T17.4.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">-</span>
</span></th></tr>
